      "content": "idk, i just feel like it's actually a fact. like, i'm just a statistical error. there's nothing special about me, no one's waiting for me to get home, no one's gonna call if i don't show up tomorrow. it just feels like the most logical thing in the world to just... exit. like, why fight against something that's already true?",
